      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this three bedroom semi-detached property to the market within the ever sought after Willsbrook Grove, Lucan. The home boasts a prime location within walking distance of Ballyowen shopping centre, schools, sports and recreational facilities. Lucan village and Liffey Valley shopping centre are also within easy reach. Public transport is excellent to and from the city centre via Dublin Bus with a bus stop only minutes' walk while the M50 gives access to the airport and beyond. \r\n\r\nInternal living accommodation of c. 97 Sqm can be found here and in brief consists of; Entrance hall, wc, living room and open plan kitchen/diner/family room to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three well-proportioned bedrooms with master benefitting from ensuite and the family bathroom. Externally this property benefits from a well-manicured and fully enclosed SOUTH/WEST facing garden with patio area and side access to the front which offers a driveway for off road parking. \r\n\r\nNo. 3 comes to the market in some need of cosmetic updating throughout but offers a fantastic opportunity to purchase a well located home and put your own stamp on it, further benefits here include gas central heating, double glazed windows and a cul de sac location. Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nBer C\r\nc. 97 sqm\r\n3 bed, 3 bath\r\nDriveway to Front\r\nHighly sought after development\r\nCul de sac location\r\nClose to amenities\r\nMature lsettings\r\nGas central heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nFantastic opportunity\r\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nK78 YR68"
      },
